## F4 slice 2: string interpolation. `"hi {who()}, the answer is {answer()}!"` desugars to a `+` chain with
## each hole wrapped in str(...), so it means exactly `"hi " + str(who()) + ", the answer is " + str(answer()) + "!"`.
fn who() -> str = "lume"
fn answer() -> int = 42
print "hi {who()}, the answer is {answer()}!"
